<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran launched a drone that struck Kuwait, killing two Italian nationals, and Iran denies responsibility while Italy says the drone was made in Iran. Iran has hit the same merchant vessels twice to deter traffic through the Strait of Hormuz and the US military has disabled two commercial ships attempting to breach Iran's blockade in the Gulf of Oman. Australia sanctioned Iranian agents suspected of directing antisemitic attacks in Sydney and Melbourne. The conflict continues with ongoing missile activity and development of an underground facility between key nuclear sites. 123 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/world/middleeast/italians-killed-iran-drone-attack-kuwait.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/f9c4da80-cc2c-4b0b-b083-b7acd0337790?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/25/uk-food-inflation-sharp-rise-next-year-mounting-cost-pressures-bank-of-england&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE84MS0wVkVZd2d0cERMVnF5eDhmS1ZaMVNrZG9tTWFIY19DaW9PcHJWYXpYejB5YVF2Z01PeTlSeGdkT2wyUWlQNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/11/28/iran-war-live-italy-says-drone-in-deadly-kuwait-attack-was-made-in-iran?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/